   "source": [
    "# PFZ ML Notebook for Bay of Bengal\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook downloads ERA5 and Copernicus data, prepares features, trains a PFZ model, and predicts PFZ for 2026-10-04 and 2026-10-05.\n",
    "\n",
    "Fixes from the previous error:\n",
    "- ERA5 uses `valid_time`, not `time`\n",
    "- Copernicus CLI uses `--variable`, not `--variables`\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
